突然想起，我在 5月20日 回复 </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/0xcryptowizard">@<!-- -->0xcryptowizard</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 说brc721把素材存IPFS感觉不对的推文时，就写了：

