可从Github上递归更新的文档部分里看到：开发者的设计思想是想保持铭文是“immutable and self-contained”，即保持Ordinals数据是“不可变”和“自给自足”的。
而依赖任何外部资源，会改变这个核心设计原则。</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-md" style="aspect-ratio:1.088785046728972"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/coolish/status/1668627182284079121/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="high" height="1712" width="1864" alt="" class="w-full" decoding="async" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FygmBqEaQAcz7TP?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FygmBqEaQAcz7TP?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FygmBqEaQAcz7TP?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FygmBqEaQAcz7TP?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/coolish/status/1668627182284079121/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-100/50" data-href="/coolish/status/1668209595339403264" data-timeline-entry="" role="link" tabindex="0"><article><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 p-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/coolish" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-6 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@coolish" cl